What that

01:07:11.200 --> 01:07:12.560
>> was? Okay,

01:07:12.640 --> 01:07:13.200
so

01:07:13.440 --> 01:07:14.240
there's

01:07:14.240 --> 01:07:14.800
two

01:07:15.120 --> 01:07:17.840
