01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:18.960
a regular home,

01:07:19.725 --> 01:07:23.485
if it's to be deemed affordable, it would have a forty year deed restriction.

01:07:24.125 --> 01:07:28.685
And the ten year deed restriction is for if you went out in

01:07:28.685 --> 01:07:33.325
your yard and built an accessory apartment or an accessory dwelling unit,

01:07:33.960 --> 01:07:37.560
you would only need a ten year deed restriction on that

01:07:38.280 --> 01:07:40.360
to have that count is affordable.

01:07:40.520 --> 01:07:43.080
And what that means is that the

01:07:44.360 --> 01:07:45.320
price increase

01:07:46.175 --> 01:07:49.295
in the accessory dwelling unit or the home

01:07:49.455 --> 01:07:56.495
would be limited to the consumer price index for the forty years or ten years, whichever was applicable to that situation.

01:07:59.700 --> 01:08:00.660
Shadhill.

